msgid "Student"
msgstr "Siswa"

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__academic_term_id
msgid "The academic term this growth report covers."
msgstr "Periode akademik yang dicakup laporan perkembangan ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__academic_year_id
msgid "The academic year this growth report covers."
msgstr "Tahun ajaran yang dicakup laporan perkembangan ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report_line__construct_id
msgid "The character construct this growth line profiles."
msgstr "Konstruk karakter yang diprofilkan oleh baris perkembangan ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report_line__evidence_ids
msgid ""
"The character evidence entries that support this growth line, drawn only "
"from legitimate character observations (the sole admissible evidence source)."
msgstr "Entri bukti karakter yang mendukung baris perkembangan ini, hanya diambil dari observasi karakter yang sah (satu-satunya sumber bukti yang dapat diterima)."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report_line__report_id
msgid "The character growth report document this line belongs to."
msgstr "Dokumen laporan perkembangan karakter tempat baris ini berada."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__pathway
msgid ""
"The character-learning pathway (lite/core/full) this report is compiled at, "
"chosen per school."
msgstr "Jalur pembelajaran karakter (ringkas/inti/penuh) tempat laporan ini disusun, dipilih per sekolah."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__date
msgid "The date this Character Growth Report document was drawn up."
msgstr "Tanggal dokumen Laporan Perkembangan Karakter ini disusun."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report_line__next_step
msgid ""
"The feedforward next step for the student to pursue on this construct, "
"phrased as growth language."
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya (feedforward) yang ditempuh siswa pada konstruk ini, dirumuskan dengan bahasa pertumbuhan."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report_line__narrative
msgid ""
"The formative narrative describing how the student grew on this construct, "
"phrased as growth language (ICLAD Bab 14.4). Free text with no fixed labels "
"or scores."
msgstr "Narasi formatif yang menggambarkan perkembangan siswa pada konstruk ini, dirumuskan dengan bahasa pertumbuhan (ICLAD Bab 14.4). Teks bebas tanpa label atau skor baku."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__homeroom_teacher_id
msgid "The homeroom teacher who compiles this growth report."
msgstr "Wali kelas yang menyusun laporan perkembangan ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__overall_narrative
msgid ""
"The overall, formative growth narrative for the student across this term, "
"phrased as growth language (ICLAD Bab 14.4). Free text with no fixed labels "
"or scores."
msgstr "Narasi perkembangan formatif secara keseluruhan bagi siswa selama periode ini, dirumuskan dengan bahasa pertumbuhan (ICLAD Bab 14.4). Teks bebas tanpa label atau skor baku."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__line_ids
msgid ""
"The per-construct growth lines: for each construct the achieved level, the "
"growth narrative, the feedforward next step, and the linked character "
"evidence."
msgstr "Baris perkembangan per konstruk: untuk setiap konstruk berisi level yang dicapai, narasi perkembangan, langkah berikutnya (feedforward), dan bukti karakter yang terhubung."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report_line__level_id
msgid ""
"The scale level the student achieved for this construct, taken from the "
"configured character scale. Never hardcoded."
msgstr "Level skala yang dicapai siswa pada konstruk ini, diambil dari skala karakter yang dikonfigurasi. Tidak pernah ditulis permanen di kode."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__student_id
msgid "The student whose character growth this report profiles."
msgstr "Siswa yang perkembangan karakternya diprofilkan oleh laporan ini."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__calibration_id
msgid ""
"The teacher calibration session that validates the scoring behind this "
"report, kept as a validation reference."
msgstr "Sesi kalibrasi guru yang memvalidasi penskoran di balik laporan ini, disimpan sebagai rujukan validasi."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__name
msgid ""
"Transaction/document number\n"
"\n"
"* Unique indentifer of transaction\n"
"* Leave '/' to automatically generate number\n"
"* Change '/' into any number/identifier to manually assign number.\n"
"  Manual number assignment can be done in 'Draft' state\n"
"  Only user with 'Can Manualy Assign Number' policy can manually assign "
"number.\n"
"* Transaction with number other than '/' can not be deleted."
msgstr ""
"Nomor transaksi/dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengenal unik transaksi\n"
"* Biarkan '/' agar nomor dibuat otomatis\n"
"* Ubah '/' menjadi nomor/pengenal apa pun untuk memberi nomor secara manual.\n"
"  Pemberian nomor manual dapat dilakukan pada status 'Draf'\n"
"  Hanya pengguna dengan kebijakan 'Dapat Memasukkan Nomor Dokumen Manual' yang dapat memberi nomor secara manual.\n"
"* Transaksi dengan nomor selain '/' tidak dapat dihapus."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__activity_exception_decoration
msgid "Type of the exception activity on record."
msgstr "Jenis aktivitas pengecualian pada rekaman."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__message_unread
msgid "Unread Messages"
msgstr "Pesan yang Belum Dibaca"

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__message_unread_counter
msgid "Unread Messages Counter"
msgstr "Penghitung Pesan yang Belum Dibaca"

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:res.groups,name:ssi_school_character_growth_report.school_character_growth_report_user_group
msgid "User"
msgstr "Pengguna"

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__user_id
msgid ""
"User that responsible for document\n"
"\n"
"* Create user can be different with responsible user\n"
"* Automatically filled with user that initiate document creation.\n"
"  Default responsible can be changed."
msgstr ""
"Pengguna yang bertanggung jawab atas dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Pengguna pembuat dapat berbeda dengan pengguna penanggung jawab\n"
"* Terisi otomatis dengan pengguna yang memulai pembuatan dokumen.\n"
"  Penanggung jawab bawaan dapat diubah."

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__reviewer_id
msgid ""
"User that responsible to review document\n"
"\n"
"* Unless it configured to approve reviewer does not equal to approver"
msgstr ""
"Pengguna yang bertanggung jawab memeriksa dokumen\n"
"\n"
"* Kecuali dikonfigurasi untuk menyetujui, pemeriksa tidak sama dengan penyetuju"

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__active_approver_user_ids
msgid "Users that can approve/reject document"
msgstr "Pengguna yang dapat menyetujui/menolak dokumen"

#. module: ssi_school_character_growth_report
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:ssi_school_character_growth_report.field_school_character_growth_report__website_message_ids
